{
  "course": "初中60短文",
  "passage": 21,
  "title": "Passage 21",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 1,
      "sourceSentenceId": 1,
      "chunkId": "s21-p01",
      "image": "assets/images/01.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p01.mp3",
      "en": "You are always told to wash your hands before dining.",
      "cn": "你总是被叮嘱用餐前要洗手。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 2,
      "sourceSentenceId": 2,
      "chunkId": "s21-p02",
      "image": "assets/images/02.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p02.mp3",
      "en": "You know you must wash your hands after going to the bathroom or touching a litter bin.",
      "cn": "你知道上完厕所或触碰垃圾桶后必须洗手。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 3,
      "sourceSentenceId": 3,
      "chunkId": "s21-p03",
      "image": "assets/images/03.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p03.mp3",
      "en": "Do you know how to wash your hands correctly to keep away from germs and flu virus?",
      "cn": "但你知道如何正确洗手才能远离细菌和流感病毒吗？"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 4,
      "sourceSentenceId": 4,
      "chunkId": "s21-p04",
      "image": "assets/images/04.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p04.mp3",
      "en": "Always use soap to wash your hands.",
      "cn": "一定要用肥皂洗手。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 5,
      "sourceSentenceId": 5,
      "chunkId": "s21-p05",
      "image": "assets/images/05.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p05.mp3",
      "en": "After turning on the tap and wetting your hands, you can rub your hands with soap.",
      "cn": "打开水龙头，把手弄湿后，就可以用肥皂搓手了。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 6,
      "sourceSentenceId": 6,
      "chunkId": "s21-p06",
      "image": "assets/images/06.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p06.mp3",
      "en": "Soap may not kill all the germs, but it can wash away the grease on your skin.",
      "cn": "肥皂可能无法杀死所有细菌，但可以洗去皮肤上的油脂。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 7,
      "sourceSentenceId": 7,
      "chunkId": "s21-p07",
      "image": "assets/images/07.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p07.mp3",
      "en": "As the grease is washed away, the germs will leave your hands and go away.",
      "cn": "随着油脂被洗掉，细菌也会被带走冲掉。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 8,
      "sourceSentenceId": 8,
      "chunkId": "s21-p08",
      "image": "assets/images/08.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p08.mp3",
      "en": "You should wash your hands for 15-20 seconds.",
      "cn": "你应该洗手15到20秒。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 9,
      "sourceSentenceId": 9,
      "chunkId": "s21-p09",
      "image": "assets/images/09.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p09.mp3",
      "en": "How do you know the length of 15-20 seconds?",
      "cn": "那怎么知道15到20秒有多长呢？"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 10,
      "sourceSentenceId": 10,
      "chunkId": "s21-p10",
      "image": "assets/images/10.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p10.mp3",
      "en": "You can sing ABC Song.",
      "cn": "你可以唱《字母歌》。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 11,
      "sourceSentenceId": 11,
      "chunkId": "s21-p11",
      "image": "assets/images/11.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p11.mp3",
      "en": "By the time you get to the last note, your hands will be clean.",
      "cn": "等你唱到最后一个音符时，你的手就洗干净了。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 12,
      "sourceSentenceId": 12,
      "chunkId": "s21-p12",
      "image": "assets/images/12.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p12.mp3",
      "en": "Then you can pull your hands out from under the tap.",
      "cn": "这时你就可以把手从水龙头下移开了。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 13,
      "sourceSentenceId": 13,
      "chunkId": "s21-p13",
      "image": "assets/images/13.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p13.mp3",
      "en": "Rub your hands together.",
      "cn": "双手一起搓洗。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 14,
      "sourceSentenceId": 14,
      "chunkId": "s21-p14",
      "image": "assets/images/14.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p14.mp3",
      "en": "You can use one hand to rub the back of the other hand and then exchange two hands to repeat this.",
      "cn": "你可以用一只手搓另一只手的手背，然后两手交换，重复这个动作。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 15,
      "sourceSentenceId": 15,
      "chunkId": "s21-p15",
      "image": "assets/images/15.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p15.mp3",
      "en": "You also need to rub between your fingers.",
      "cn": "你还需要搓洗每根手指之间的位置。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 16,
      "sourceSentenceId": 16,
      "chunkId": "s21-p16",
      "image": "assets/images/16.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p16.mp3",
      "en": "Don't forget to rub under and around your fingernails.",
      "cn": "也别忘了搓指甲缝和指甲周围。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 17,
      "sourceSentenceId": 17,
      "chunkId": "s21-p17",
      "image": "assets/images/17.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p17.mp3",
      "en": "Maybe your hands don't look dirty, but there are germs on them.",
      "cn": "也许你的手看起来不脏，但上面会有细菌。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 18,
      "sourceSentenceId": 18,
      "chunkId": "s21-p18",
      "image": "assets/images/18.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p18.mp3",
      "en": "Germs are too small for you to see.",
      "cn": "细菌非常小，你看不到。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 19,
      "sourceSentenceId": 19,
      "chunkId": "s21-p19",
      "image": "assets/images/19.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p19.mp3",
      "en": "They are on your hands all the time.",
      "cn": "它们一直附着在你的手上。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 20,
      "sourceSentenceId": 20,
      "chunkId": "s21-p20",
      "image": "assets/images/20.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p20.mp3",
      "en": "Many illnesses are caused by germs.",
      "cn": "许多疾病都是由细菌引起的。"
    },
    {
      "cover": false,
      "sentenceId": 21,
      "sourceSentenceId": 21,
      "chunkId": "s21-p21",
      "image": "assets/images/21.png",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s21-p21.mp3",
      "en": "Therefore, wash your hands carefully before enjoying your strawberries, pancakes or potato salad!",
      "cn": "因此，在享用草莓、薄饼或土豆沙拉之前，一定要认真洗手！"
    }
  ],
